## Subtracting days across month boundaries

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope SubDays:
  output previous_month content date
  output leap_day content date
  output previous_year content date
  output many_months content date
  output addition content date

scope SubDays:
  definition previous_month equals |2024-03-15| - 20 day
  assertion previous_month = |2024-02-24|
  definition leap_day equals |2024-03-01| - 1 day
  assertion leap_day = |2024-02-29|
  definition previous_year equals |2024-01-10| - 15 day
  assertion previous_year = |2023-12-26|
  definition many_months equals |2024-03-15| - 400 day
  assertion many_months = |2023-02-09|
  definition addition equals |2024-03-15| + 20 day
  assertion addition = |2024-04-04|
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope SubDays
┌─[RESULT]─ SubDays ─
│ previous_month = |2024-02-24|
│ leap_day = |2024-02-29|
│ previous_year = |2023-12-26|
│ many_months = |2023-02-09|
│ addition = |2024-04-04|
└─
```
